### 第 12 阶段：抢票生成订单
POST http://localhost:18086/api/orders/grab
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 9700,
  "sessionId": 101,
  "ticketCategoryId": 1001
}

### 第一次支付，把订单 id 换成上一步返回值
POST http://localhost:18086/api/orders/replace-with-order-id/pay

### 第二次重复支付，仍然使用同一个订单 id，预期返回同一张电子票
POST http://localhost:18086/api/orders/replace-with-order-id/pay

### 查询订单，预期状态保持 PAID
GET http://localhost:18086/api/orders/replace-with-order-id
